WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.340
Ateliê Verde connects the customer experience with
gardening and landscaping management.

2
00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:14.822
A project developed by Leandro Augusto Ferreira, featuring
a store, services, projects and Rafinha, the virtual
assistant.

3
00:00:15.762 --> 00:00:23.586
In the store, customers find plants, pots, tools and
accessories in organized categories.

4
00:00:23.836 --> 00:00:30.796
The interface brings products and services together, with
photos and information to help customers choose.

5
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:38.848
Filters help customers find products by category, light
conditions, environment and plant type.

6
00:00:39.098 --> 00:00:44.186
Search and growing information make browsing more
practical.

7
00:00:45.137 --> 00:00:51.257
On the product page, customers can enlarge photos and read
about plant care.

8
00:00:51.507 --> 00:00:58.227
Accessories also have individual images, such as this
green two-liter watering can.

9
00:00:59.178 --> 00:01:06.642
The services area offers pruning, irrigation, garden
installation and consulting.

10
00:01:06.892 --> 00:01:11.812
Customers can learn about each service and request an
appointment.

11
00:01:12.762 --> 00:01:20.490
Projects track landscaping from planning through
maintenance, with organized stages and information.

12
00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:28.156
Plant species, materials, a schedule and a two-dimensional
plan help visualize the space.

13
00:01:29.095 --> 00:01:37.783
Rafinha keeps conversational context, analyzes photos and
searches sources when needed through an authorized ChatGPT
connection.

14
00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:47.969
His expressions follow the conversation. Each installation
uses its own account; developer credentials are not
included.

15
00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:57.256
The admin dashboard brings together revenue, sales,
ongoing projects and stock alerts.

16
00:01:57.506 --> 00:02:04.562
Metrics are calculated from stored data, with date filters
to monitor operations.

17
00:02:05.512 --> 00:02:11.704
Inventory and suppliers connect with orders, services and
financial records.

18
00:02:11.954 --> 00:02:19.298
Revenue, expenses and reports help monitor the business
and review its transaction history.

19
00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:26.484
The Windows demo brings everything together in a local
application with fictional data.

20
00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:32.878
Discover Ateliê Verde in the portfolio and explore both
the customer and administrator experiences.
